{"title":"Receiver","slug":"Receiver","hero":{"file":"Missing_Image.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":1884,"revid":9573,"timestamp":"2024-02-09T15:39:49Z","lastEditor":"Er0rd0tExe","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"functionality","text":"Functionality"}],"body":"<blockquote><p><i>\"Wirelessly obtains a signal from a transmitter and outputs the signal based on the assigned keyphrase.\"</i></p></blockquote><p>Not to be confused with <span title=\"Laser Receiver (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGFzZXJfUmVjZWl2ZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Laser Receiver</span></p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Missing Image\">Missing Image</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Missing_Image.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2 id=\"functionality\">Functionality</h2>\n<p>The receiver outputs whenever a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Transmitter/\">transmitter</a> with the same value (string of text) is activated. This also works across other player's bases that are in the same server.\n</p>"}
